GRAPH <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_FrameIndexArchitecture> {
  <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_FrameIndexArchitecture> a narr:Digest ;
    narr:digestOf <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#FrameIndexArchitecture> ;
    narr:childCount "32"^^xsd:integer ;
    narr:generatedFrom "d47e17f24a950a0d71348dc45b695a3faf9b06c6" ;
    narr:narration """This stratum asks what an index page must carry so a reader gets context, not a bare position. The governing move is [the unit of expand must return the context around a position, never a single position](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_9), with [calls and narratives listed by IRI and everything beneath them as frames without one](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_10) and [an actor hub as one level down, linking to calls, narratives and positions](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_8). A [document page should show the full package and its edges at navigational fidelity](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_11), while [the MCP page stays at its size cap and root dumps to file are refused](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_12) — with the consequence that [a long call is one expand result with no split](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_13). The ordering principle holds that [steering comes first, then recall of the full set, then precision](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_19), grounded in [statements as support for a direction, never ends in themselves](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_21). On frame-only reading, [a frame alone is not the carrier of meaning, and frame-only relevance location answers only maybe](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_23), so [a judge sees a position whole, never a sample of three](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_24). The measurement arc runs from [rejecting production's own placements as the test target](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_25) through [a judged-set design with big models picking and small models overlaid](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_27) and [a complement pass added when the pool proved non-exhaustive](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_32), to [measured recall and token-cost findings across document shapes and models](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_39). It lands in [the ruled split: steering stays ours, recall and precision come from engine primitives](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_44), after [the concession that the hand-rolled read layer was the weak link](narr:Expr_20261011_1_VerifyPr1031WrappingQuotesRepairOnDev_h2e601120d6cc_42). Four broader narratives frame it: [the unit of expand carries context](narr:Narrative_ExpandUnitContext), [steering precedes recall](narr:Narrative_ReadPathOrder), [recall is judged against an oracle](narr:Narrative_RecallOracleFirst), and [steering is ours while recall belongs to an engine](narr:Narrative_SteeringRecallSeparation).""" ;
